# Directory Structure

## How Projects Are Organized

When you run `/start`, it asks for a **project name**. All output files go under
`[project-name]/` so multiple projects can coexist in the same repo without
collision. For example, if your project is `attention-study`:

```
attention-study/
├── your-notes.docx      ← drop your own files here (the root is your drop zone)
├── prior-draft.md       ← the lab reads everything sitting directly here
├── research/            ← lab-managed: hypotheses, proposals, study designs
├── experiments/         ← lab-managed: specs, configs, results
├── papers/              ← lab-managed: drafts, outline, compiled PDF
└── ...
```

**The drop zone convention:** anything placed directly in `[project-name]/` — not
inside a subdirectory — is treated as user-provided input material. The lab reads
these files on `/start` and uses them to understand where the project is at. All
lab-managed output goes into subdirectories. This keeps user material and lab
output cleanly separated.

The active project is stored in `CLAUDE.md` under `Active Project:`. Every hook
reads this field and prefixes all output paths automatically via `lib.sh`.

If you choose **"Use repo root"** at the project-name prompt, files go to the
repo root directly (no subfolder). In that case the drop zone is the repo root
itself, and subdirectories are still lab-managed.

---

## Repo-Level Files

```
/
├── CLAUDE.md                        # Master config — paradigm, language, active project
│
├── .claude/                         # Lab config (committed directly — no setup needed)
│   ├── agents/                      # 22 agent definitions
│   ├── commands/                    # 39 slash command definitions
│   ├── hooks/                       # 13 lifecycle hooks
│   │   └── lib.sh                   # Shared path helpers (get_project_dir, ppath, pmkdir)
│   ├── scripts/                     # compile_paper.py, export_survey.py
│   ├── docs/                        # Documentation and templates
│   └── rules/                       # Path-specific rules
```

---

## Project Output Directory

All paths below are prefixed with `[project-name]/` when `Active Project` is set.

```
[project-name]/
│
├── (your files here)                # Drop zone — user material, read by /start
│
├── research/                        # Research documents (lab-managed)
│   ├── hypothesis.md                # THE research hypothesis (anchor document)
│   ├── proposal.md                  # Full research proposal
│   ├── study-design.md              # Social Science: study design
│   ├── irb-protocol.md              # Social Science: IRB ethics submission
│   ├── instruments/                 # Survey instruments, interview guides
│   └── research-log.md              # Running log of decisions and pivots
│
├── literature/                      # Literature review (lab-managed)
│   ├── survey.md                    # Literature survey by theme
│   ├── gap-analysis.md              # Property matrix and gap statement
│   ├── bibliography.bib             # BibTeX references
│   └── papers/                      # Individual paper notes
│
├── experiments/                     # Experiment management — ML Track (lab-managed)
│   ├── eval-protocol.md             # LOCKED evaluation protocol
│   ├── specs/                       # Experiment specs (one per experiment)
│   ├── configs/                     # YAML configs (one per experiment run)
│   ├── results/                     # Experiment outputs — IMMUTABLE (guarded by hook)
│   ├── run-log.md                   # Git hash log for every run
│   └── baseline-plan.md             # Baseline comparison plan
│
├── src/                             # Research source code (lab-managed)
│   ├── models/
│   ├── data/
│   ├── training/
│   ├── evaluation/
│   └── utils/
│
├── data/                            # Data files (lab-managed)
│   ├── raw/                         # Original data (read-only)
│   └── processed/
│
├── baselines/                       # Baseline implementations (lab-managed)
│
├── analysis/                        # Analysis scripts and outputs (lab-managed)
│   ├── figures/
│   └── outputs/
│
├── papers/                          # Paper drafts (lab-managed)
│   ├── outline.md
│   ├── STATUS.md                    # Section progress dashboard (auto-updated)
│   ├── drafts/
│   ├── main.tex                     # Assembled LaTeX (from /compile-paper)
│   └── main.pdf                     # Compiled PDF (from /compile-paper)
│
└── production/                      # Project management (lab-managed)
    ├── milestones/
    ├── sprints/
    └── session-state/
        └── active.md                # Recovery point after context loss
```

---

## Key Files

| File | Owned By | Purpose |
|------|----------|---------|
| `[project]/research/hypothesis.md` | `principal-investigator` | THE anchor document |
| `[project]/experiments/eval-protocol.md` | `lead-researcher` | Locked before experiments |
| `[project]/papers/outline.md` | `paper-author` | Paper structure |
| `[project]/production/session-state/active.md` | All | Recovery point after context loss |
| `[project]/research/research-log.md` | `principal-investigator` | Decision history (append-only) |

---

## Gitignore Recommendations

```gitignore
# Large data files
*/data/raw/
*/data/processed/
*/experiments/results/
*/experiments/logs/

# Session state
*/production/session-state/

# Generated outputs
*/analysis/outputs/

# Hook state
.experiment-notify-manifest

# Environment
*.egg-info/
__pycache__/
.env
```
